--- !u!114 &684217258
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 684217256}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 14ce5c596a29e284c91b0e2209200b81, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  encounterID: 
  active: 1
  blockInteraction: 0
  dialog:
  - text: "Wait up! Stop!\r"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1314645892}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Mad
  - text: You MURDERER!
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Mad
  - text: "I didn\u2019t kill him!\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1314645892}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Surprised
  - text: ' No?! Well, how can you explain what I saw you do to Spartan Jack?

'
    name: Stretch
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Mad
  - text: "After you went to look for the second intruder, I realized I wasn\u2019t
      myself.. I was being controlled.\r\n"
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1314645892}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: Controlled? Like... Mind control?
    name: Thad
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: 'Not quite...

      I was having these thoughts...

      But they weren''t
      mine...'
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1314645892}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: I'm not sure what's real anymore. It could have been some high-level E-S-Pow...
      But here's what really happened...
    name: Storm
    character: {fileID: 1314645892}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Sigh
  turnToFace: 0
  snapPlayerPosition: 0
